  m_Name: Planet_Earth
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  ObjectName: Earth
  Facts:
  - text: "Earth is the only planet we know that has life \u2014 that means plants,
      animals, and people all live here!"
  - text: "About 70% of Earth is covered in water, which is why it's sometimes called
      the \u201CBlue Planet.\u201D"
  - text: "Earth has air we can breathe, made mostly of nitrogen and oxygen \u2014
      super important for all living things!"
  - text: "It takes 365 days for Earth to go around the Sun, and that\u2019s what
      we call a year!"
  - text: "Earth has one moon, and it helps create the ocean\u2019s tides and lights
      up the night sky."
  BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e83594484b7f0db4c93e8add46f64fb6, type: 3}
